let values be a list of 2, 4, 6.
assert (med of values) is equal to (median of values).
assert (prod of values) is equal to (product of values).
assert (med of values) is equal to 4.
assert (prod of values) is equal to 48.
let med be 9.
let prod be 7.
assert med is equal to 9.
assert prod is equal to 7.
print "Compact median and product OK".
